#
# Elecrow DIS08070H modules of the external flash (/ext): they are too big for the 960 kB bank of the firmware.
# They are sent by upload-ext (to /ext/bin, their units and rules to /ext/cfg) and start when the ext service has mounted /ext.
#

#
# The graphical interface: dmdevfs reports the display (dmlcdtft, flash.dmd) to libsystemd, dmview.rules starts a dmview@<name> for it,
# which shows what the applications claim for it. The views are turned by DMBOOT_DISPLAY_ROTATION (board.cmake).
#
dmview
dmview service=dmview@.ini
dmview rules=dmview.rules

#
# The input: dmdevfs reports the touch panel (dmgt911, flash.dmd) as an input, inputd.rules starts an inputd for it, which hands what it
# reports to libinput, where dmview reads the events of the inputs of its display (the same friends_group) from.
#
inputd
inputd service=inputd@.ini
inputd rules=inputd.rules
